  "retainedAlgorithms": {
    "AnalyzeRule.kt": [
      "getString/getStringList/getElement/getElements",
      "splitSourceRule and inner SourceRule",
      "makeUpRule and replaceRegex",
      "put/get precedence including false-valued Elvis results",
      "evalJS bindings java=this and actual Java result objects",
      "per-instance compiled-script/regex/source-rule caches"
    ],
    "RuleDataInterface.kt": "Original archive bytes unchanged, including length < 10000 and Boolean returns",
    "RuleData.kt": "Original implementation; only GSON import is redirected",
    "AnalyzeUrl.kt": [
      "Finite URL script phase only: analyzeJs then replaceKeyPageJs, followed by existing SourceJavaHost HTTP preparation.",
      "Original case-insensitive @js/<js>, @result replacement order, String/Double/null formatting, first-end-delimiter innerRule overload, and page alternatives including original edge-case exceptions.",
      "Actual Rhino java=this and original FQN Book/BookSource bindings; source inline jsLib/CryptoJS and environment-owned scopes reused.",
      "Nested JsExtensions ajax/connect defaults are key/page/ruleData/chapter null and baseUrl empty. No inherited parent search input.",
      "Full analyzeUrl/getStrResponse, option.js/bodyJs, dynamic source headers, extraParams/infoMap/speech configuration, WebView/DNS/media/rate limiting and Android persistence are not ported."
    ]
  },
  "platformSeams": [
    "Android annotations and TextUtils empty checks replaced by JVM equivalents",
    "java=this; source/book/chapter use actual original fully qualified Java class names with the finite model APIs listed below",
    "Cache backing and big-variable storage are owned in-memory data, not Room/filesystem; original text and binary key spaces remain distinct; onlyDisk selects the text backing map, not a physical disk",
    "Cache seconds/typed memory/50 MiB access-order limit and original source cache keys retained",
    "Scopes use original inline-library/CryptoJS algorithms, owner+thread crypto identity and weak 16-entry caches; shared-global state additionally namespaced to the explicit RuleEnvironment lifetime",
    "Scope creation serializes only matching library or owner/thread keys with same-thread reentrancy; metadata/condition monitors do not execute scripts, Job cancellation and environment close notify same-key condition waiters, compiled CryptoJS stays environment-owned, and close rejects later publication; arbitrary initializer host calls are not interrupted",
    "Default RulePlatform still has no HTTP delegate. Explicit task-bound ProductionRulePlatform expands the finite original AnalyzeUrl URL-script phases then uses the sole existing JVM HTTP/session cookie/deadline path; complete AnalyzeUrl, browser, update-book, batch, RSS and remote/map jsLib remain unported",
    "Unsupported capability and cancellation exceptions escape ajax error-text recovery",
    "Coroutine context can be supplied explicitly; the optional production adapter is bound to the existing RuntimeTask. App traditional reader routing remains unintegrated",
    "Android Base64 flags/byte-array overloads explicitly unsupported; default String/charset overload follows Hutool 5.8.22 decoding, default encoding is Android NO_WRAP-equivalent UTF-8",
    "Original pure Gson adapters are retained for String/Int/Map; Android rule-model and LocalDate adapters are not installed",
    "Explicit close releases environment state and scope handles; original Android app-global persistence is not claimed"
  ],
